# Architecture

- Layers: `src/routes/<name>` → `src/common` → `src/types`
- One Lambda handler package per route; do not invent Express/Fastify
- Shared Dynamo/S3/SES/logger/errors live in `src/common/`
- Webpack zip + CFN Handler paths are load-bearing
- Authorizer is a sibling TOKEN Lambda; Cognito issues tokens
- See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/API_CONTRACT.md`, `docs/INFRA.md`
